Following is the cURL request to delete a challenge. This action is irreversible.

curl --location --request DELETE 'https://api.onecompiler.com/v1/challenges/<challenge_id>?access_token=<your_access_token>'
Read a challenge
Following is the cURL request to read a challenge along with the problems.

curl --location 'https://api.onecompiler.com/v1/challenges/<challenge_id>?access_token=<your_access_token>'
Update a challenge & problems
Following is the cURL request to update a challenge & problems.

curl --location 'https://api.onecompiler.com/v1/challenges/update?access_token=<your_access_token>' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "challenge": {_id: "3w7dbyxyz", ...},
    "problems": [
        {_id: "3w7dbyxy1", ...},
        {_id: "3w7dbyxy2", ...},
        {_id: "3w7dbyxy3", ...}
    ]
}'
