Sections are used to group the problems in the challenge. You can assign the problems to sections while updating the challenge & problems via API (This is not available while creating the challenge via API). Please include the sections details as shown below as part of the challenge data in the request body.

"challenge": {
    _id: "3w7dbyxyz",
